["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ドレス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">连衣裙；女装</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231285\">あのドレスは<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>によく<ruby>似合<rp>(</rp><rt>にあ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">That dress really becomes her.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">泥</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">泥；泥巴；（湿）泥土；贼；小偷；安卓系统</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111106\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はブーツの<ruby>泥<rp>(</rp><rt>どろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をこすり<ruby>落<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He scraped the mud off his boots.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どんな</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">连体词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">連体詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">什么样的；什么种类的；什么；无论什么样的；无论什么；任何；所有</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"159217\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどんな<ruby>戦争<rp>(</rp><rt>せんそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にも<ruby>反対<rp>(</rp><rt>はんたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I&#x27;m opposed to any type of war.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どんなに</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">怎样；多少；到什么程度；无论怎样；不管多么</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"177247\"><ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>きみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がどんなに<ruby>心配<rp>(</rp><rt>しんぱい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しているかを<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You don&#x27;t know how worried I am.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">名</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">な</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">名字；姓名；名称；标题；名声；名誉；声誉；借口；托词；名义；表面</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"90819\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>歌手<rp>(</rp><rt>かしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>として<ruby>名<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>挙<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She made a name for herself as a singer.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n3:v:内容\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">内容</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ないよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">内容</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>会議<rp>(</rp><rt>かいぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>内容<rp>(</rp><rt>ないよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をメールで<ruby>伝<rp>(</rp><rt>つた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">用邮件传达了会议内容。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なお</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">仍然；还是；尚；更加；更；越发；而且；并且；另外；此外；仿佛；好像；如同</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234309\">あとで<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こったことはなお<ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">What followed was still worse.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">仲</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">关系；人际</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"154354\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とは<ruby>訪問<rp>(</rp><rt>ほうもん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う<ruby>仲<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I am on visiting terms with him.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">半ば</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なかば</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">中间；中途；半路；一半；二分之一；半；部分地；在某种程度上；大致上；几乎；差不多</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"93529\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は４０<ruby>代<rp>(</rp><rt>だい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>半<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ばで<ruby>再婚<rp>(</rp><rt>さいこん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She married again in her mid-forties.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">仲間</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なかま</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">伙伴；同伴；朋友；伙计；战友；搭档；同事；同僚；群体；集团；圈子；帮派；同类；同族；同级</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91235\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>仲間<rp>(</rp><rt>なかま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>付<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She is mixing with the wrong crowd.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">流す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ながす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">排；流；倒；冲；流血；流泪；溢出；漂；放流；使漂流；冲走；冲刷；冲散；播放；播送；播送；输送；传播；散布；流传；巡游；徘徊；揽客；取消；撤销；拒绝；弃子；悠闲地做；轻松地做；毫不费力地做；流放；放逐；打向相反方向；漫不经心地做；不专心地做；敷衍；流产；堕胎</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229552\">あんな<ruby>恐<rp>(</rp><rt>おそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ろしい<ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のために<ruby>流<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>す<ruby>涙<rp>(</rp><rt>なみだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I cannot shed a tear for that horrible man.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">眺め</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ながめ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">景色；风景；景观；远景</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"126084\"><ruby>眺<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めのよい<ruby>部屋<rp>(</rp><rt>へや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をお<ruby>願<rp>(</rp><rt>ねが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いします。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I&#x27;d like a room with a good view.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">眺める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ながめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">看；凝视；注视；盯着；俯瞰；眺望；欣赏（如风景）；旁观；袖手旁观；观察</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"187417\"><ruby>何時間<rp>(</rp><rt>なんじかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>海<rp>(</rp><rt>うみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>眺<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I gazed at the sea for hours.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">流れ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ながれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">流动；水流；气流；人流；事物流动；时光流逝；潮流；趋势；倾向；事件的进程；步骤；程序；过程；散场后聚在一起的人群；血统；家系；流派；（金融）流当；止赎；没收（抵押品）；取消；撤销；漂泊；流浪；漫游</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"78261\"><ruby>流<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れは<ruby>池<rp>(</rp><rt>いけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>注<rp>(</rp><rt>そそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いでいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The stream falls into the pond.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">流れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ながれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">流动；流淌（液体、时间等）；洇开（墨水等）；被冲走；被（水流）带走；漂流；漂浮（如云彩）；飘荡；流浪；传播（如谣言）；蔓延；流传；被听到（如音乐）；被播放；陷入（如懒散、绝望）；流逝；消逝；被传递；被取消；中止；（抵押品）成为死当；（权利）丧失；消失；被消除</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124072\"><ruby>当時<rp>(</rp><rt>とうじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はきれいな<ruby>水<rp>(</rp><rt>みず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がこの<ruby>川<rp>(</rp><rt>かわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にも<ruby>流<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Pure water was washed away to this river as well at that time.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">無し</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">无；没有；不可接受；不行；不令人满意；不存在；没有</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192872\">ようやくその<ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>貸<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>借<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>無<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しになった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I am finally quits with the man.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なぜなら</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">因为；理由是；如果你想知道为什么</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199225\">なぜなら<ruby>新聞記者<rp>(</rp><rt>しんぶんきしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だったからです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Because I was a newspaper reporter.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">謎</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なぞ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">谜语；谜题；谜团；神秘事物；神秘的；谜一样的；莫测的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"120756\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がなぜ<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をやめたのかは<ruby>謎<rp>(</rp><rt>なぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It is a mystery why he quit his job.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">納得</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なっとく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">同意；赞成；接受；理解；信服；满意</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"236543\">「そっか」ウィリーはようやく<ruby>納得<rp>(</rp><rt>なっとく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">&quot;Well, OK,&quot; Willie finally agreed.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n3:v:懐かしい\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">懐かしい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なつかしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">令人怀念的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">この<ruby>歌<rp>(</rp><rt>うた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くと、<ruby>懐<rp>(</rp><rt>なつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かしい<ruby>気持<rp>(</rp><rt>きも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちになる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">一听这首歌就觉得很怀念。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">什么；那个东西；你懂的；那玩意儿；那什么东西；那谁；阴茎；那话儿；（一点也）不；（毫）不；什么？；嗯？；喂！；搞什么！；什么嘛（表示恼怒）；没事；没关系；哪里</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"172752\"><ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のアナウンスは<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だったのですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">What did the announcement just say?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何か</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なにか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">某事；某物；什么东西；不知为何；莫名其妙；你想说什么？；你是什么意思？</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なにも</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">（没有）任何东西；什么都不；（一点）都没有；以及其他一切；等等；（一点）都不；丝毫不；不怎么；不至于那样</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"186512\"><ruby>過<rp>(</rp><rt>あやま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちのない<ruby>者<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He who makes no mistakes makes nothing.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">鍋</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なべ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">锅；平底锅；炊具；炖菜；火锅</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224417\">ここに<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のないナベがある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Here is a pan without handles.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">生</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なま</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">生的；未煮熟的；新鲜的；天然的；原样的；未经编辑的；未加工的；（口语）无套的（性行为）；不戴安全套的；实况的；直播的；非录制的；无经验的；不熟练的；生涩的；粗糙的；傲慢无礼；没大没小；放肆；生啤酒；扎啤；鲜啤酒；空白的（如光盘）；未使用的；略微；稍许；隐约；部分；半；准；不足的；不完整的；半生不熟的；敷衍的；（古）现金；现钱；微醉；醉意</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74282\">ゴムをすると<ruby>確<rp>(</rp><rt>たし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かに<ruby>性感<rp>(</rp><rt>せいかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>落<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちるので、<ruby>出来<rp>(</rp><rt>でき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れば<ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>なま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でしたいです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The sensitivity certainly drops if I use a condom, so if possible I&#x27;d like to do it bareback.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">怠ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なまける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">偷懒；怠惰；懈怠；怠慢（工作等）；