/span></span><span class=\"v-m\">烦恼；苦恼；为难</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"121757\"><ruby>悩<rp>(</rp><rt>なや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでも<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>利益<rp>(</rp><rt>りえき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にもならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">There is no profit in worrying.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n3:v:慣れる\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">慣れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">习惯</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>日本<rp>(</rp><rt>にほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>生活<rp>(</rp><rt>せいかつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にもう<ruby>慣<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">已经习惯日本的生活了。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">縄</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なわ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">绳子；绳索；绳带；警绳</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"180474\"><ruby>強盗<rp>(</rp><rt>ごうとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>後<rp>(</rp><rt>うし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ろ<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>縄<rp>(</rp><rt>なわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>縛<rp>(</rp><rt>しば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The burglar tied my hands behind my back with a rope.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何で</span><spa